    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="d9/d93/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1util_1_1_bit_cube" kindref="compound">BitCube</ref> is a multi-dimensional set of bits. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For every multi-dimensional point (N0, N1, ...) the corresponding bit&apos;s id is calculated as: <preformatted><computeroutput>
   N0 + D0*(N1 + D1*(N2 + ...))
 </computeroutput>
where <emphasis>Di</emphasis> is a size of dimension <emphasis>i</emphasis>.
</preformatted></para>
    </detaileddescription>
